              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Data presented in the paper \"NetSquid, a discrete-event simulation platform for quantum networks\" (https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.12535).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This file contains four compressed tarballs (tar.gz files), each containing data of a particular use case:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><code>quantum_switch_data</code>: a quantum switch (see plots in sec. IIB in the paper)</li>\r\n<li><code>nv_repeater_chain_data</code>: nitrogen-vacancy based repeater chain (sec. IIC)</li>\r\n<li><code>ae_repeater_data</code>: atomic-ensemble based repeater (sec. IID)</li>\r\n<li><code>benchmarking_data</code>: benchmarking NetSquid's runtime</li>\r\n</ul>"
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionDate",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "2021-03-09"
                }
              }
            ]
